    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "01f1afb6009e17d492e203bc790f17e3",
        "content": [
          "## Carrier identity\r\n",
          "- Use `dim_carrier.carrier_name`, never `carrier_code` alone ΓÇö codes are reused across distinct airlines over time (e.g., \"OH\" = Comair through 2011, then PSA Airlines from 2017). Join on `carrier_code` AND `flight_date BETWEEN effective_start AND effective_end`.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "## Delay and on-time metrics\r\n",
          "- Delay averages: exclude cancelled/diverted flights (`is_cancelled = false AND is_diverted = false`) ΓÇö delay minutes are null otherwise.\r\n",
          "- Cancellation/diversion rates: include all flights.\r\n",
          "- On-time = `arr_del15 = false`; delayed = `arr_del15 = true`. Coalesce the five delay-cause columns to 0, not null, when aggregating.\r\n",
          "- Averaging a rate across carriers/routes/months: use flight-count-weighted average, not a mean of pre-computed percentages.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "## Route ranking (best/worst on-time)\r\n",
          "- Never rank by raw on-time % ΓÇö low-volume routes distort it. Use:\r\n",
          "  `on_time_arr_score = (1000 * 0.8009 + completed_count * raw_on_time_pct) / (1000 + completed_count)`\r\n",
          "  (`completed_count` = non-cancelled/diverted flights; matches the dashboard's Route Analysis page.) Only apply when *ranking*; plain \"on-time % for route X\" uses the raw rate.\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "## Known anomalies (mention, don't silently correct)\r\n",
          "- 2020: inflated on-time % from reduced pandemic-era volume, not real improvement.\r\n",
          "- Jan 2018: ~27% volume discontinuity from a DOT reporting change, not an activity change.\r\n",
          "- `air_time_min` unreliable when `air_time_unreliable = true` (JetBlue/Hawaiian 2004ΓÇô2006, SkyWest JanΓÇôJul 2004).\r\n",
          "\r\n",
          "## Column preferences\r\n",
          "- Prefer `route`, `departure_time_block`, `haul_length` over reconstructing equivalent logic from `origin`/`dest`/`crs_dep_time_hhmm`/`distance_mi`. Only build custom distance buckets if the user explicitly asks for finer granularity than Short/Medium/Long."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "example_question_sqls": [
      {
        "id": "01f1afb669e8146486f8acbc48a1c022",
        "question": [
          "Which carriers have the best on-time arrival percentage?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  dc.carrier_name,\r\n",
          "  COUNT(*) AS total_flights,\r\n",
          "  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN f.arr_del15 = false THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100 / COUNT(*), 2) AS on_time_pct\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "JOIN airline_analytics.gold.dim_carrier dc\r\n",
          "  ON f.carrier_code = dc.carrier_code\r\n",
          " AND f.flight_date BETWEEN dc.effective_start AND dc.effective_end\r\n",
          "WHERE f.is_cancelled = false AND f.is_diverted = false\r\n",
          "GROUP BY dc.carrier_name\r\n",
          "ORDER BY on_time_pct DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afb686ae155b8b85d02b0f605019",
        "question": [
          "What is the average departure delay in minutes for each carrier? "
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  dc.carrier_name,\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.dep_delay_min) / COUNT(*) AS avg_dep_delay_min\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "JOIN airline_analytics.gold.dim_carrier dc\r\n",
          "  ON f.carrier_code = dc.carrier_code\r\n",
          " AND f.flight_date BETWEEN dc.effective_start AND dc.effective_end\r\n",
          "WHERE f.is_cancelled = false AND f.is_diverted = false\r\n",
          "GROUP BY dc.carrier_name\r\n",
          "ORDER BY avg_dep_delay_min DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afb6a12518439d8b587e4a5dc830",
        "question": [
          "Break down Delta Air Lines' arrival delays by cause"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.carrier_delay_min) AS carrier_delay,\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.weather_delay_min) AS weather_delay,\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.nas_delay_min) AS nas_delay,\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.security_delay_min) AS security_delay,\r\n",
          "  SUM(f.late_aircraft_delay_min) AS late_aircraft_delay\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "JOIN airline_analytics.gold.dim_carrier dc\r\n",
          "  ON f.carrier_code = dc.carrier_code\r\n",
          " AND f.flight_date BETWEEN dc.effective_start AND dc.effective_end\r\n",
          "WHERE dc.carrier_name = 'Delta Air Lines'\r\n",
          "  AND f.has_delay_cause_detail = true"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afb6c0e71de282ecacc1929ac945",
        "question": [
          "Compare cancellation rates across carriers"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  dc.carrier_name,\r\n",
          "  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN f.is_cancelled THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)*100 / COUNT(*), 2) AS cancellation_rate\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "JOIN airline_analytics.gold.dim_carrier dc\r\n",
          "  ON f.carrier_code = dc.carrier_code\r\n",
          " AND f.flight_date BETWEEN dc.effective_start AND dc.effective_end\r\n",
          "GROUP BY dc.carrier_name\r\n",
          "ORDER BY cancellation_rate DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afb704b0171f849baf598cb118e9",
        "question": [
          "How has on-time performance changed over the years for the carrier code OH?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  dc.carrier_name,\r\n",
          "  f.year,\r\n",
          "  COUNT(*) AS total_flights,\r\n",
          "  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN f.arr_del15 = false THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)*100 / COUNT(*), 2) AS on_time_pct\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "JOIN airline_analytics.gold.dim_carrier dc\r\n",
          "  ON f.carrier_code = dc.carrier_code\r\n",
          " AND f.flight_date BETWEEN dc.effective_start AND dc.effective_end\r\n",
          "WHERE f.carrier_code = 'OH'\r\n",
          "  AND f.is_cancelled = false AND f.is_diverted = false\r\n",
          "GROUP BY dc.carrier_name, f.year\r\n",
          "ORDER BY f.year"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afcf3d961b31b542307ac4330fec",
        "question": [
          "What are the busiest routes by flight volume?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\r\n",
          "  f.route,\r\n",
          "  COUNT(*) AS total_flights\r\n",
          "FROM airline_analytics.gold.fct_flights f\r\n",
          "WHERE f.is_cancelled = false AND f.is_diverted = false\r\n",
          "GROUP BY f.route\r\n",
          "ORDER BY total_flights DESC\r\n",
          "LIMIT 10"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "01f1afcf4cef1d5e9a73d7fb1e1f40a0",
        "question": [
